{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测macOS绕过Gatekeeper并执行。对应需求：防御规避。官方：Gatekeeper Override and Execution。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】macOS绕过Gatekeeper并执行","risk_score":73,"rule_id":"8154d01d-04d1-4695-bcbb-95a1bb606355","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: macOS","主题: 防御规避","来源: 默认","对应需求: 防御规避"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nmacOS绕过Gatekeeper并执行\n\n### 为何重要\n绕过防护、伪装或擦痕\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","query":"configuration where host.os.type == \"macos\" and event.action == \"gatekeeper_override\" and\n  file.path like (\"/Volumes/*\", \"/Users/*/Applications/*\", \"/Applications/*\",\n                  \"/tmp/*\", \"/private/tmp/*\", \"/var/tmp/*\", \"/private/var/tmp/*\", \"/Users/Shared/*\",\n                  \"/Users/*/Downloads/*\", \"/Users/*/Desktop/*\", \"/Users/*/Documents/*\")\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1553","name":"Subvert Trust Controls","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1553/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1553.001","name":"Gatekeeper Bypass","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1553/001/"}]},{"id":"T1562","name":"Impair Defenses","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1562/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1562.001","name":"Disable or Modify Tools","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1562/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1204","name":"User Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1204/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1204.002","name":"Malicious File","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1204/002/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"}],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 macOS 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":3,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now","references":[]}
